Notes on libnsgif as bundled with Chafa
=======================================

The libnsgif bundled with Chafa is currently based on upstream commit
22e99eb6818b1284d0f3ff1b7f46159e87221220 (2026-08-05; release 1.0.0 plus five
later commits). The original source is here:

https://www.netsurf-browser.org/projects/libnsgif/
https://github.com/netsurf-browser/libnsgif

It has been slightly adapted from the original to make it fit into the Chafa
build. It may have further modifications to make it more convenient to use
in this context.

It is my intention to submit any generally useful enhancements made for
potential inclusion upstream.
